{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/45b504dce3fb14073608a698be13d1f8.avif?t=1763545349\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras_big/45b504dce3fb14073608a698be13d1f8.avif?t=1763545349 width=800 height=122 /></span>Pick your character and step into Amer\u2019s world where the fights hit harder than your mom\u2019s slipper and the drama feels like a family WhatsApp group gone wrong. No floppy animals or jelly bodies here, just families settling scores, uncles jumping in for no reason, and chaos that actually makes sense to us. Whether you're teaming up or turning on each\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0other like always, expect wild twists, loud laughs, and pure Arab-style madness in the party fighting game\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/7661d894c1cd25559100e767181221b2.poster.avif?t=1763545349\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/7661d894c1cd25559100e767181221b2.webm?t=1763545349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/d41859e09110308f5c9a6ce09cad2cdb.poster.avif?t=1763545349\" width=700 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/d41859e09110308f5c9a6ce09cad2cdb.webm?t=1763545349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/713f2cbf4c53486e74bab2087a971062.avif?t=1763545349\" width=1006 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Grab, lift, and throw, it\u2019s as simple as that, and somehow\u2026 it creates the most chaos\u00a0 <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Our grab mechanic lets you pick up your friends, carry them around, and launch them straight off the map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Every match becomes funnier, louder, and way more unpredictable the moment someone decides to start<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 grabbing everyone in sight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/1a3486c77d260ee04652be20c53082d7.poster.avif?t=1763545349\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/1a3486c77d260ee04652be20c53082d7.webm?t=1763545349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/fb8db553b086d7bca77aca759b9b0a6d.avif?t=1763545349\" width=1006 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your characters don\u2019t just fight they start talking, yelling, and throwing random voice lines in the middle\u00a0of the\u00a0 chaos\u00a0Every match turns into a mix of reactions, roasting, and unexpected screams that make the whole round\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0way\u00a0funnier\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Turn up your volume and enjoy the madness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/a859f585db238fa1171d2b190798b0a7.poster.avif?t=1763545349\" width=1170 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/a859f585db238fa1171d2b190798b0a7.webm?t=1763545349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/13f7feb957cd5b522059bc728ddc0d61.avif?t=1763545349\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras_big/13f7feb957cd5b522059bc728ddc0d61.avif?t=1763545349 width=800 height=171 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Get ready for the ultimate family fighting game! Choose</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > from a variety of exciting maps, each with its own unique theme and challenges, for an unforgettable experience filled\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \